{"id":"reference/C","kind":"langref","title":"C","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#C","file":"reference/C.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"C","text":"C"},{"depth":3,"slug":"C-Type-Primitives","text":"C 基本类型"},{"depth":3,"slug":"C-Translation-CLI","text":"C 翻译命令行工具"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Command-line-flags","text":"命令行选项"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Using--target-and--cflags","text":"使用 -target 与 -cflags"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Translation-failures","text":"翻译失败"},{"depth":3,"slug":"C-Pointers","text":"C 指针"},{"depth":3,"slug":"C-Variadic-Functions","text":"C 可变参数函数"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Exporting-a-C-Library","text":"导出 C 库"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Mixing-Object-Files","text":"混合目标文件"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"C\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#C\">C</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 独立于 C，也不像多数其他语言那样依赖 libc，但它重视与现有 C 代码交互。</p>\n      <p>Zig 通过多种方式便利 C 互操作。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"C-Type-Primitives\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#C-Type-Primitives\">C 基本类型</a></h3>\n\n      <p>这些类型保证兼容 C ABI，可以像其他类型一样使用。</p>\n      <ul>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_char</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_short</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_ushort</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_uint</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_long</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_ulong</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_longlong</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_ulonglong</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-type\">c_longdouble</span></code></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>与 C 的 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 类型交互时，使用 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyopaque</span></code>。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Primitive-Types\">基本类型</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"C-Translation-CLI\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#C-Translation-CLI\">C 翻译命令行工具</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 的 C 翻译能力通过命令行工具 <kbd>zig translate-c</kbd> 提供。必须传入一个文件名参数，还可接收一组转交给 clang 的可选参数。翻译后的文件写入标准输出。</p>\n      <h4 id=\"Command-line-flags\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#Command-line-flags\">命令行选项</a></h4>\n\n      <ul>\n        <li><kbd>-I</kbd>：指定头文件搜索目录，可以重复使用。等价于 <a href=\"https://releases.llvm.org/12.0.0/tools/clang/docs/ClangCommandLineReference.html#cmdoption-clang-i-dir\">clang 的 <kbd>-I</kbd> 选项</a>。默认<em>不</em>包含当前目录，可使用 <kbd>-I.</kbd> 将其包含。</li>\n        <li><kbd>-D</kbd>：定义预处理器宏。等价于 <a href=\"https://releases.llvm.org/12.0.0/tools/clang/docs/ClangCommandLineReference.html#cmdoption-clang-d-macro\">clang 的 <kbd>-D</kbd> 选项</a>。</li>\n        <li><kbd>-cflags [flags] --</kbd>：向 clang 传递任意附加<a href=\"https://releases.llvm.org/12.0.0/tools/clang/docs/ClangCommandLineReference.html\">命令行选项</a>。注意，选项列表必须以 <kbd>--</kbd> 结束。</li>\n        <li><kbd>-target</kbd>：翻译后 Zig 代码的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Targets/#Targets\">目标三元组</a>。未指定时，使用当前宿主目标。</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <h4 id=\"Using--target-and--cflags\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#Using--target-and--cflags\">使用 -target 与 -cflags</a></h4>\n\n      <p><strong>重要！</strong>使用 <kbd>zig translate-c</kbd> 翻译 C 代码时，<strong>必须</strong>使用与编译翻译后代码时相同的 <kbd>-target</kbd> 三元组。此外，如有使用 <kbd>-cflags</kbd>，<strong>必须</strong>确保它与目标系统代码采用的 cflags 一致。错误的 <kbd>-target</kbd> 或 <kbd>-cflags</kbd> 可能导致 clang 或 Zig 解析失败，或者在链接 C 代码时出现隐蔽的 ABI 不兼容问题。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"c-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">varytarget.h</cite></figcaption><pre><code>long FOO = __LONG_MAX__;</code></pre></figure>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig translate-c -target thumb-freestanding-gnueabihf varytarget.h|grep FOO</kbd>\npub export var FOO: c_long = 2147483647;\n$ <kbd>zig translate-c -target x86_64-macos-gnu varytarget.h|grep FOO</kbd>\npub export var FOO: c_long = 9223372036854775807;\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"c-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">varycflags.h</cite></figcaption><pre><code>enum FOO { BAR };\nint do_something(enum FOO foo);</code></pre></figure>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig translate-c varycflags.h|grep -B1 do_something</kbd>\npub const enum_FOO = c_uint;\npub extern fn do_something(foo: enum_FOO) c_int;\n$ <kbd>zig translate-c -cflags -fshort-enums -- varycflags.h|grep -B1 do_something</kbd>\npub const enum_FOO = u8;\npub extern fn do_something(foo: enum_FOO) c_int;\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      \n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Translation-failures\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#Translation-failures\">翻译失败</a></h3>\n\n      <p>部分 C 结构无法翻译为 Zig，例如 <em>goto</em>、带位域的结构体和进行标记拼接的宏。Zig 采用<em>降级</em>机制，在遇到不可翻译实体时继续翻译。</p>\n      <p>降级有三种形式：<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/opaque/#opaque\">opaque</a>、<em>extern</em> 和 <code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@compileError</span></code>。无法正确翻译的 C 结构体与联合会转换为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">opaque</span>{}</code>。包含不透明类型或不可翻译代码结构的函数，会降级为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span></code> 声明。因此，不可翻译的类型仍可通过指针使用；只要链接器知道其编译后函数，不可翻译的函数仍可调用。</p>\n      <p>顶层定义（全局变量、函数原型、宏）无法翻译或降级时，使用 <code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@compileError</span></code>。Zig 对顶层声明采用惰性分析，因此除非实际使用这些不可翻译实体，否则不会导致编译错误。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/opaque/#opaque\">opaque</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#extern\">extern</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#compileError\">@compileError</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"C-Pointers\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#C-Pointers\">C 指针</a></h3>\n\n      <p>应尽可能避免此类型。使用 C 指针唯一合理的理由，是它出现在翻译 C 代码自动生成的代码中。</p>\n      <p>导入 C 头文件时，指针应该翻译为单项指针 <code>*T</code> 还是多项指针 <code>[*]T</code> 并不明确。C 指针是一种折中，使 Zig 代码可以直接使用翻译后的头文件。</p>\n      <p><code>[*c]T</code> —— C 指针。</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>支持另外两种指针类型 <code>*T</code> 和 <code>[*]T</code> 的全部语法。</li>\n        <li>可以强制转换为其他指针类型及<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Pointers\">可选指针</a>。C 指针强制转换为非可选指针时，如果地址为零，就会发生需要安全检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>。</li>\n        <li>允许零地址。在非独立环境目标上，解引用零地址属于需要安全检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>。可选 C 指针会像 <code>?<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code> 一样引入额外的一位来记录空值。不过无须创建可选 C 指针，直接使用普通<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Pointers\">可选指针</a>即可。</li>\n        <li>支持与整数之间进行<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">类型强制转换</a>。</li>\n        <li>支持与整数比较。</li>\n        <li>不支持对齐等 Zig 专属指针属性。请使用普通<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>C 指针指向单个结构体而非数组时，需要先解引用 C 指针，再访问结构体字段或成员数据，语法如下：</p>\n        <p><code>ptr_to_struct.*.struct_member</code></p>\n        <p>这类似于 C 中的 <code>-&gt;</code>。</p>\n        <p>C 指针指向结构体数组时，语法恢复为：</p>\n        <p><code>ptr_to_struct_array[index].struct_member</code></p>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"C-Variadic-Functions\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#C-Variadic-Functions\">C 可变参数函数</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 支持 extern 可变参数函数。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_variadic_function.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> testing = std.testing;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"c\"</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">printf</span>(format: [*:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, ...) <span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"variadic function\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">14</span>, printf(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"Hello, world!\\n\"</span>));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expect(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(printf)).@\"fn\".attrs.varargs);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_variadic_function.zig -lc</kbd>\n1/1 test_variadic_function.test.variadic function...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\nHello, world!\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>可使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#cVaStart\">@cVaStart</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#cVaEnd\">@cVaEnd</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#cVaArg\">@cVaArg</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#cVaCopy\">@cVaCopy</a> 实现可变参数函数。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_defining_variadic_function.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> testing = std.testing;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> builtin = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"builtin\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add</span>(count: <span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, ...) <span class=\"tok-kw\">callconv</span>(.c) <span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ap = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@cVaStart</span>();\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@cVaEnd</span>(&amp;ap);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sum: <span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i &lt; count) : (i += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) {\n        sum += <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@cVaArg</span>(&amp;ap, <span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> sum;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"defining a variadic function\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (builtin.cpu.arch == .aarch64 <span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span> builtin.os.tag != .macos) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/14096</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SkipZigTest;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (builtin.cpu.arch == .x86_64 <span class=\"tok-kw\">and</span> builtin.os.tag == .windows) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/16961</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SkipZigTest;\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (builtin.cpu.arch == .s390x) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/21350#issuecomment-3543006475</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SkipZigTest;\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>), add(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>), add(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>)));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>), add(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>), <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>)));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_defining_variadic_function.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_defining_variadic_function.test.defining a variadic function...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Exporting-a-C-Library\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#Exporting-a-C-Library\">导出 C 库</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 的主要用例之一是导出 C ABI 库，以供其他编程语言调用。在函数、变量和类型前添加 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span></code> 关键字，使它们成为库接口的一部分：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">mathtest.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a + b;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>创建静态库：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-lib mathtest.zig</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>创建共享库：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-lib mathtest.zig -dynamic</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>以下是使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Build-System/#Zig-Build-System\">Zig 构建系统</a>的示例：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"c-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test.c</cite></figcaption><pre><code>// This header is generated by zig from mathtest.zig\n#include \"mathtest.h\"\n#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char **argv) {\n    int32_t result = add(42, 1337);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", result);\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">build_c.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">build</span>(b: *std.Build) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> lib = b.addLibrary(.{\n        .linkage = .dynamic,\n        .name = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"mathtest\"</span>,\n        .root_module = b.createModule(.{\n            .root_source_file = b.path(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"mathtest.zig\"</span>),\n        }),\n        .version = .{ .major = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, .minor = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, .patch = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> },\n    });\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> exe = b.addExecutable(.{\n        .name = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"test\"</span>,\n        .root_module = b.createModule(.{\n            .link_libc = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n        }),\n    });\n    exe.root_module.addCSourceFile(.{ .file = b.path(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"test.c\"</span>), .flags = &amp;.{<span class=\"tok-str\">\"-std=c99\"</span>} });\n    exe.root_module.linkLibrary(lib);\n\n    b.default_step.dependOn(&amp;exe.step);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> run_cmd = exe.run();\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> test_step = b.step(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"test\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"Test the program\"</span>);\n    test_step.dependOn(&amp;run_cmd.step);\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build test</kbd>\n1379\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#export\">export</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Mixing-Object-Files\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#Mixing-Object-Files\">混合目标文件</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 目标文件可以与任何遵循 C ABI 的其他目标文件混合使用。例如：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">base64.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> base64 = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).base64;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">decode_base_64</span>(\n    dest_ptr: [*]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    dest_len: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>,\n    source_ptr: [*]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    source_len: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>,\n) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> src = source_ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..source_len];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> dest = dest_ptr[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..dest_len];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> base64_decoder = base64.standard.Decoder;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> decoded_size = base64_decoder.calcSizeForSlice(src) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>;\n    base64_decoder.decode(dest[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..decoded_size], src) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> decoded_size;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"c-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test.c</cite></figcaption><pre><code>// This header is generated by zig from base64.zig\n#include \"base64.h\"\n\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char **argv) {\n    const char *encoded = \"YWxsIHlvdXIgYmFzZSBhcmUgYmVsb25nIHRvIHVz\";\n    char buf[200];\n\n    size_t len = decode_base_64(buf, 200, encoded, strlen(encoded));\n    buf[len] = 0;\n    puts(buf);\n\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">build_object.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">build</span>(b: *std.Build) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> obj = b.addObject(.{\n        .name = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"base64\"</span>,\n        .root_module = b.createModule(.{\n            .root_source_file = b.path(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"base64.zig\"</span>),\n        }),\n    });\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> exe = b.addExecutable(.{\n        .name = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"test\"</span>,\n        .root_module = b.createModule(.{\n            .link_libc = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n        }),\n    });\n    exe.root_module.addCSourceFile(.{ .file = b.path(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"test.c\"</span>), .flags = &amp;.{<span class=\"tok-str\">\"-std=c99\"</span>} });\n    exe.root_module.addObject(obj);\n    b.installArtifact(exe);\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./zig-out/bin/test</kbd>\nall your base are belong to us\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Targets/#Targets\">目标平台</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Build-System/#Zig-Build-System\">Zig 构建系统</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":64,"translated":64}}
